Table full name: bigquery-public-data.census_bureau_usa.population_by_zip_2010
Column name: geo_id Type: STRING Description: Geo code
Column name: zipcode Type: STRING Description: Five digit ZIP Code Tabulation Area Census Code
Column name: population Type: INT64 Description: The total count of the population for this segment.
Column name: minimum_age Type: INT64 Description: The minimum age in the age range. If null, this indicates the row as a total for male, female, or overall population.
Column name: maximum_age Type: INT64 Description: The maximum age in the age range. If null, this indicates the row as having no maximum (such as 85 and over) or the row is a total of the male, female, or overall population.
Column name: gender Type: STRING Description: male or female. If empty, the row is a total population summary.
